                  "type": "externalDfnReference",
                  "url": "https://w3c.github.io/aria/#assistive-technology",
                  "xrefSpec": "aria",
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": ". Web pages that use WebMCP can be thought of as Model Context Protocol ",
