                  "url": "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/latest",
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": " servers that implement tools in client-side script instead of on the backend. WebMCP enables collaborative workflows where users and agents work together within the same web interface, leveraging existing application logic while maintaining shared context and user control.",
